# Glowcap Lantern: it grants its abilities to the creature it is attached to now (CR 301.5c, 613.1f). Turn 1 it is equipped to
# the Ornithopter; turn 3 Bot1 pays Equip {2} again to move it to the Memnite and attacks with both. Only the Memnite has
# "Whenever this creature attacks, it explores": it reveals the Lightning Bolt, gets the +1/+1 counter (a 2/2) and, Bot1
# declining the graveyard, leaves it on top. The Ornithopter attacking too explores nothing and has no counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Memnite
Glowcap Lantern
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

